#: HDRIRotator/preferences.py:117
msgid "Automatically sync rotation between World HDRI and Built-in HDRI when they use the same texture source"
msgstr "当世界 HDRI 与内置 HDRI 使用相同纹理源时，自动同步两者的旋转"

#: HDRIRotator/preferences.py:44
msgid "Clamp Power Values"
msgstr "钳制功率值"

#: HDRIRotator/preferences.py:44
msgid "Clamp strength/power adjustments to each target's recommended minimum and maximum range"
msgstr "将强度/功率调整钳制在每个目标推荐的最小和最大范围内"

